        <type><ref refid="classbool" kindref="compound">bool</ref></type>
        <definition>bool llvm::objcarc::RRInfo::KnownSafe</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>KnownSafe</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::objcarc::RRInfo::KnownSafe</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= false</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>After an objc_retain, the reference count of the referenced object is known to be positive. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Similarly, before an objc_release, the reference count of the referenced object is known to be positive. If there are retain-release pairs in code regions where the retain count is known to be positive, they can be eliminated, regardless of any side effects between them.</para>
<para>Also, a retain+release pair nested within another retain+release pair all on the known same pointer value can be eliminated, regardless of any intervening side effects.</para>
<para>KnownSafe is true when either of these conditions is satisfied. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
